{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026g4AAWzjwWk1794349563.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國上月通脹率較市場預期高，現貨金價曾跌百分之3。</p><p></p><p>紐約期金收市報4,030.2美元一盎司，跌84.3美元，跌幅百分之2。現貨金價一度跌至4,013.7元一盎司，跌126.12美元，跌幅百分之3。</p><p></p><p>Marex分析員梅爾表示，整體消費物價指數及核心消費物價指數都略高於預期，所有數據都不如預期理想。利率期貨市場顯示，交易員已開始預測聯儲局下月可能加息半厘的機會率達到百分之13.6。市場原先不預期會加息半厘，不利沒有利息回報的黃金。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T23:08:49.114689+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":215,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T22:17:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T18:56:28.205136+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T23:02:03.420476+00:00","content_hash":"8935092ae185c3bd34a5d5b4d943310ba90f6a93185489128441ab87412f151d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-10T23:08:49.114689+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}